OL,3,GNEWSAA guide to August Bank Holiday
OL,4,Atravel in the South East
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople travelling over the August Bank
OL,7,FHoliday are being warned to expect busy
OL,8,Froads and some rail line closures due
OL,9,Fto engineering works.
OL,11,FThe south-east of England is expected
OL,12,Fto have some of the busiest roads in
OL,13,Fthe country, as well as major transport
OL,14,Fhubs including Gatwick Airport and the
OL,15,FPort of Dover, connecting the UK to
OL,16,Fmainland Europe.
OL,18,FWe take a look at what travellers can
OL,19,Fexpect over the long weekend:
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,328,320,200,140,0,100
