OL,3,GNEWSAA guide to August Bank Holiday
OL,4,Atravel in the South East
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe RAC says it estimates 20 million
OL,7,Fleisure trips will be made by car
OL,8,Fbetween Friday and Monday, as the
OL,9,Fsummer holidays draw to a conclusion.
